        "message": "Consciousness-as-connectivity (IIT phi) + GNWT workspace marks + dashboard\n\nMirro's 'consciousness level' implemented as a real, measurable metric\ngrounded in consciousness research (IIT connectivity + GNWT workspace):\n\n- scripts/algorithms.py: new _integrated_info() - IIT-style phi: share of\n  frequent terms that span two or more knowledge clusters (0..1); exposed in\n  status() as consciousness_phi. Live value on current corpus: phi=0.86\n  (5171/6000 cross-cluster terms, 12 clusters; top links generated-ru,\n  general-generated, code-general).\n- core/mirro_core.py: build_response now tags each answer with a 'workspace'\n  field (GNWT) describing which layer/memory produced it (local trigger, web\n  freshness, base cluster with IIT connectivity, fallback provider).\n- web/mirro-meysto-dashboard.html + data snapshot: new 'Уровень сознания'\n  card showing phi, shared terms and top cross-cluster links; fresh data\n  re-embedded.\n\nbuild --check: ALL CHECKS PASSED.",
